    "sections": {
        "description": "Waste Disposal Theme provides a clean and organized website layout intended for waste collection, recycling information, disposal services, and environmental awareness content. The design includes responsive sections, customizable homepage layouts, service listings, team sections, and contact information areas to support clear content arrangement on different screen sizes. The theme features editable color settings, typography options, banner sections, blog layouts, and widget-enabled areas for flexible customization. It supports navigation menus, image galleries, testimonials, and social media integration to improve content accessibility and user interaction. Standard compatibility with commonly used plugins allows additional functionality without affecting the overall layout structure. The codebase follows modern design and formatting practices for stable performance and browser support. Additional customization settings for headers, footers, and page templates help maintain a consistent visual presentation throughout the website."
    },
